# Model display names

Owner decision, 2026-09-05, supersedes the earlier requirement to display every catalog prefix and provider suffix.

- Use the shortest correct model name. Preserve its version and distinguishing variant.
- Omit redundant provider names and parentheses: Fable 5.1, Opus 5, Sonnet 5, GPT-5.6 Sol, GPT-6 Astra.
- Keep generator transport distinctions such as grok-api and grok-web.
- Do not ellipsize, clamp, or truncate the resulting display name. Wrap it when space is limited.
- Keep exact provider model IDs and catalog keys in requests and stored records.
- Use role labels to distinguish separate participants using the same model.
